**Get start line**

```method : public : GetStartLine() ~ Int```



return: Int

```
analysis := System.Diagnostics.Analyzer->ParseFile("app.obs");
defn := analysis->FindDefinition("file:///app.obs", 10, 4, "/usr/lib/objeck");
if(defn <> Nil) {
  line := defn->GetStartLine(); # 0-based line of the symbol
  "line={$line}"->PrintLine();
};
analysis->Release();
```
